  "consentTextCreatePatient": "I hereby confirm that I have informed the future user and obtained their consent to process their data for the purpose of registration.",
  "consentTextCreatePatientDetail": "<b>Objective</b>\n• <b>Support for Activity Planning:</b> The aktivplan app aims to assist you and your healthcare professional in planning individual training activities and adjusting them optimally to your health condition.\n• <b>Visualization and Tracking of Activities:</b> The app allows you to view and track activities planned with your healthcare professional on your smartphone, as well as enter additional activities.\n\n<b>Procedure</b>\n• <b>Explicit Consent to Use:</b> If you explicitly agree to use the aktivplan app, the data collected in the performance test will be entered into the application by your healthcare professional.\n• <b>Performance Data - Basis for Training Plan:</b>DThe data collected in the performance test provides the basis for an individually tailored training plan. (For example, training in the optimal heart rate zone.)\n• <b>Installation via Email Link:</b> After entering your data, you will receive an email with a link. You can install the aktivplan app on your mobile phone and log in through this link. If you do not log in within the next 10 days, your data will be deleted from the application.\n\n<b>Data Protection and Data Utilization</b>\n• <b>Confidentiality:</b> All information will be treated confidentially.\n• <b>Secure Data Storage:</b> Your personal data will be pseudonymized and stored on secure servers, in accordance with the GDPR.\n• <b>Purpose of Data Utilization:</b> The recorded data is used to create a training plan tailored to you and optimally adapted to your health condition. (For example, training in the optimal heart rate zone.)\n\n<b>Voluntary Participation and Right to Withdraw</b>\n• <b>Voluntariness:</b> Use of the aktivplan app is completely voluntary.\n• <b>Automatic Data Deletion after 10 Days:</b> If you do not log in within the next 10 days using the link provided in the email, your data will be deleted from the application.\n• <b>Termination at Any Time:</b> After registration, you can, of course, terminate the use of the aktivplan app at any time, which also entails the deletion of all your data.\n\n<b>Questions</b>\n• <b>Contact Anytime:</b> If you have any questions, please feel free to get in touch at any time.",
  "consentText_PRIVACY_POLICY": "I have read and agree to the <a>Privacy Policy</a>.",
  "consentText_TERMS_AND_CONDITIONS": "I have read and agree to the <a>Terms and Conditions</a>.",
