  "onboardingText1": "<h1>Welcome!</h1>\n\nWe are delighted that you decided to use the <b>aktiv</b>plan App.\n\nWould you like to get a short overview of the most important functionalities of the app?",
  "onboardingText2": "<h1>Your training plan</h1>\n\nKeep track of your planned activities and document execution details.\n\nTo get additional information about an activity, click on it. When you have completed an activity, click on the circle to check it off.",
  "onboardingText3": "<h1>Active minutes</h1>\n\nMeet your goal each week and monitor your progress.\n\nYou collect active minutes by performing activities and checking them off.\n\nTo see more details about your progress over time, click on the graph.",
  "onboardingText3Klimafit": "<h1>Activity points</h1>\n\nMeet your goal each week and monitor your progress.\n\nYou collect activity points by performing activities and checking them off.\n\nTo see more details about your progress over time, click on the graph.",
  "onboardingText4": "<h1>Adherence to training plan</h1>\n\nAlways try to stick to the training plan developed with your health care professional and perform the activities as planned.\n\nThis graph shows you at a glance how well you are doing.",
  "onboardingText5": "<h1>Personal goals</h1>\n\nYour personal goals are displayed in the calendar for the respective day and at the bottom of the training plan page.\n\nTo see more details about a goal, click on it. To mark a goal as achieved, click on the circle.",
  "onboardingText6": "<h1>Your user profile</h1>\n\nIn your user profile you can view your data and request changes.\n\nYou can also set a &quot;Special Status&quot; which will be shown to your health care professional.",
  "onboardingText7": "<h1>Have fun being active!</h1>\n\nDiscover more functions via the menu.\n\nIf something is still unclear, you can find a comprehensive user manual under the menu item &quot;Help&quot;.",
